  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nIn https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/links.html#preload\r\nStep 8 tells us to\r\n> If options's [document](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/semantics.html#link-options-document) is \"pending\", then set request's [initiator type](https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#request-initiator-type) to \"early hint\".\r\n\r\nI'm not sure what it means for a [LinkProcessingOptions](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/semantics.html#link-processing-options) document to be `\"pending\"`, since its defined to be\r\n> Null or a [Document](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/dom.html#document) ",
